  "description": "We replicated one of our favorite steel frame paints for the 2024 all-road. Neon red/purple fade is going to scream as an all day road ride or riser + rack geared jammer. Can't wait to see how you build these up!\nIncludes our new Steel Frame, Fork, Seat Collar, Derailleur Hanger, Front and Rear Thru Axles. Available in 5 sizes.\nOur Butted Steel is ED coated before painting to fight future rust, inside and out.\nThe All-Road is built on our aggressive road geometry, and made to rip the dirt cuts in between. Clears up to 700-35 or 650-42 tires.\nCrank clears a double ring 34T-50T\nExternal routing available front and rear derailleurs. Cable routing is very clean, and highly functional.\nCan be built as a proper drop bar crusher with all day comfort, or run a positive rise stem, and more stack for a riser bar rack bike.\nSize Large Frame weighs under 5 lbs, and the fork is 2 lbs once cut. Made in Taiwan.",
